  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "3 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "3 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease two baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8s1q5TcmEJdV9sYhvw56oUYb_Vw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9826-italian-cookies-i-VAT-step-01-7a0fe215ff4f4c7da52baa5df3462924.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9826/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and baking powder in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tvaW2pOPL9vCgJhrfNHGOKp-D3o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9826-italian-cookies-i-VAT-step-02-f77d1c6ed367451b8eee26d29c223feb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9826/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and sugar in a mixing bowl with an electric mixer until smooth and creamy. Mix in eggs, one at a time, beating well after each addition. Mix in vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M5smM0hcAHTZGCHMKyHle3XMtn8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9826-italian-cookies-i-VAT-step-03-f4e677b3f9fd45d4a8b18731b765baad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9826/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually stir in flour mixture until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UnEV3u57sdQ_267q-ApyyLH5dpw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9826-italian-cookies-i-VAT-step-04-cec5ebea60cb49b2bb039feec8e962f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9826/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll walnut-sized portions of dough into small ropes. Shape each rope into a loop and press the ends to seal. Place 2 inches apart onto the prepared baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V4HsGhQ9pKsFFO498i6t5jo7Fks=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9826-italian-cookies-i-VAT-step-05-4d47337452e04bb79163546be295d493.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9826/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until firm and golden at the edges, 8 to 10 minutes. Remove from the oven and cool on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hp0HDQYeiHm6j5CyKkJVDyWA0i8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9826-italian-cookies-i-VAT-step-06-bb478d7130be4f2fbfa234e300f2409d.jpg"
